        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>We did it on Omnitron, followed next turn by Tachyon dual strike at 19+19... it was quite messy.</p><p>We go for the A solution because the card text say to deal &quot;deal each hero target X damage&quot;, so we thought the damage to be calculated at before being applied to each hero individually, and as redirection doesnt recalculate the original damage...</p><p>The timing interraction is the most complicated part of this game. And is not always consistent with other card games ruling, wich is most infortunate.&nbsp;</p>",
